#: patterns/about.php
msgctxt "Pattern title"
msgid "About"
msgstr ""

#: patterns/about.php
msgctxt "Pattern description"
msgid "A picture, two paragraphs and three rules."
msgstr ""

#: patterns/about.php:21
msgid "Hi, I’m Amara."
msgstr ""

#: patterns/about.php:30
msgid "Amara Okafor, head and shoulders, navy sweater"
msgstr ""

#: patterns/about.php:33
msgid "Amara Okafor"
msgstr ""

#: patterns/about.php:33
msgid "Coaching since 2019"
msgstr ""

#: patterns/about.php:40
msgid "For six years I ran the exit interviews at a company that lost a lot of good people. A hundred and forty conversations on someone’s last day, when they finally said what they wanted. Almost none of them had said it while they still worked there."
msgstr ""

#: patterns/about.php:43
msgid "I noticed I was taking notes for myself. I left at forty-one, late and badly timed, two months before a promotion I had wanted for years. Coaching full time since 2019, around two hundred people, most of them good at their jobs and quietly done with them."
msgstr ""

#: patterns/about.php:50
msgid "Few people at a time"
msgstr ""

#: patterns/about.php:53
msgid "So that when you write between calls, I answer the same day."
msgstr ""

#: patterns/about.php:60
msgid "No dependency"
msgstr ""

#: patterns/about.php:63
msgid "The point is that you stop needing me. Most people are done in three months."
msgstr ""

#: patterns/about.php:70
msgid "From experience"
msgstr ""

#: patterns/about.php:73
msgid "I have sat where you sit. I will tell you what I see, not what you want to hear."
msgstr ""

