#: patterns/familiar.php:29
msgid "You are good at what you do, and lately that <em>is</em> the problem."
msgstr ""

#: patterns/familiar.php:32
msgid "There is a conversation you keep rehearsing and never having."
msgstr ""

#: patterns/familiar.php:35
msgid "You have read the books. You do not need another one."
msgstr ""

