#: patterns/faq.php
msgctxt "Pattern title"
msgid "Questions"
msgstr ""

#: patterns/faq.php
msgctxt "Pattern description"
msgid "Questions and answers, one open at a time."
msgstr ""

#: patterns/faq.php:28
msgid "Is the first call really free?"
msgstr ""

#: patterns/faq.php:29
msgid "Yes. Thirty minutes, no card, no pitch. If we both think it makes sense, we talk about next steps."
msgstr ""

#: patterns/faq.php:34
msgid "Do I need to prepare anything?"
msgstr ""

#: patterns/faq.php:35
msgid "No. The two questions I send the day before are enough."
msgstr ""

#: patterns/faq.php:40
msgid "What if I need to move it?"
msgstr ""

#: patterns/faq.php:41
msgid "The confirmation email has a link to reschedule or cancel. Any time up to 24 hours before."
msgstr ""

#: patterns/faq.php:46
msgid "Which time zone is shown?"
msgstr ""

#: patterns/faq.php:47
msgid "Yours. The calendar reads it from your browser, and you can change it at the top of the card."
msgstr ""

