#: patterns/how.php
msgctxt "Pattern title"
msgid "How it works"
msgstr ""

#: patterns/how.php
msgctxt "Pattern description"
msgid "Four numbered steps, one line each."
msgstr ""

#: patterns/how.php:29
msgid "<strong>Pick a time.</strong> The calendar above shows your time zone. The Zoom link is in your inbox a minute later."
msgstr ""

#: patterns/how.php:32
msgid "<strong>Two questions.</strong> The day before, I send two short questions. No homework, just a head start."
msgstr ""

#: patterns/how.php:35
msgid "<strong>Thirty minutes.</strong> Camera on, no slides. Where you are, and what keeps getting in the way."
msgstr ""

#: patterns/how.php:38
msgid "<strong>You decide.</strong> If it makes sense to go on, I send one page with how, and what it costs. If not, no follow-up."
msgstr ""

